<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event · other</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kulturkampf</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Kulturkampf was a political conflict in the 1870s between the government of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/otto-von-bismarck">Otto von Bismarck</a> and the Catholic Church in the newly founded <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/german-empire">German Empire</a>. Laws restricted the Church's role in education and appointments, reflecting suspicion of Catholic loyalties. The campaign largely failed, strengthening the Catholic Centre Party, and was gradually wound down.</p></div>
